  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.4.2-beta.7`\n\n### Features\n\n- add Option-as-Meta terminal setting for macOS ([00c24461](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/00c24461aef85453b2c5886c873c5221b3bb66af))\n- add SFTP permissions editing, column sorting and hidden files toggle ([61227380](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/612273802a0f4bab4d9da2a5408804b3ceafc18e))\n- add keyboard-interactive and multi-step SSH authentication ([b34f23ab](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/b34f23ab6dbc8955c4f4cb0ca6ba48f366bab64f))\n- add command variables and insert confirmation to the command library ([9237bb46](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/9237bb46efe2b8e257666010afa71f917cc7f4da))\n- add known hosts management to security settings ([5988c7df](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/5988c7df275ba83b0a4fc0521612f78e79ba7477))\n- add per-connection keepalive settings to the connection dialog ([d82bfebd](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/d82bfebdd21290d73ff8c42c2bbda7a4362a859e))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- explain servers that only have an RSA host key ([19eb1539](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/19eb153933a24722c37519460533c362486f62bf))\n- fix RSA key file login by signing with ring ([131e372d](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/131e372d2f2c30e68a459f6d6ffa70f2b8ecf2ac))\n\n### Other changes\n\n- document WebDAV backup/sync and window blur in the README ([40605c7b](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/40605c7bbbb33dd13c19df80c249329f22ee68cf))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.4.2-beta.7...v0.4.2-beta.8](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.4.2-beta.7...v0.4.2-beta.8)\n",
